library "Nested Defined As".

concept "Diagnosis A":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `a`.
concept "Diagnosis B":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `b`.
concept "Diagnosis C":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `c`.
concept "A And B":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( "Diagnosis A" sem-and "Diagnosis B" ).
concept "Top":
- value type is boolean.
- defined as ( "A And B" sem-or "Diagnosis C" ).


decision "Top Coverage Determination":
first:
- when "Top" then recommend activity "certify.Approve".
- otherwise then recommend activity "not-certify.Deny".

activity "certify.Approve":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Coverage determination: APPROVE / Certified.`.
activity "not-certify.Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Coverage determination: DENY / Not Certified.`.
